Id: dbs018w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_databases
Fix: Set a requirepass, and password every ACL user.
References: redis-server(1)
Controls: CIS 5.2; NIST IA-2; ISO 8.5; CE User access control

Redis sets no password: neither requirepass nor any ACL user
carries one. Whoever reaches the server reads and writes every
key; set a password even where only localhost reaches it.
